Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.54,0:23:06.55,Ameku-op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\k25}即{\k50}使疼{\k25}痛{\k25}難{\k25}忍{\k50}（踽{\k25}踽{\k25}獨{\k51}行）{\an3}{\blur5}
